    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20884" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">hŏnestāmentum</span></b> ,
		i, n.
		honesto, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>an ornament</i>, <i>grace</i> (rare; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">not in Cic.): nullo honestamento eget virtus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Ep. 66, 2</span></i>
			.— In plur.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">omnia honestamenta pacis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sall. Or. ad Caes. 2</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">morum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">App. Mag. p. 276</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">orationis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Gell. 10, 26, 4</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Cod. Theod. 12, 1, 4</span></i>.</div>
